<td id="S3.T1.4.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_t">202</td>
<td id="S3.T1.4.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_t">150</td>
<td id="S3.T1.4.2.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_t">143</td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T1.4.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T1.4.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">50–99</td>
<td id="S3.T1.4.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">287</td>
<td id="S3.T1.4.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">227</td>
<td id="S3.T1.4.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">187</td>
<td id="S3.T1.4.3.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">148</td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T1.4.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T1.4.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">100–149</td>
<td id="S3.T1.4.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">75</td>
<td id="S3.T1.4.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">56</td>
<td id="S3.T1.4.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">60</td>
<td id="S3.T1.4.4.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">45</td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T1.4.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T1.4.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">150–199</td>
<td id="S3.T1.4.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">45</td>
<td id="S3.T1.4.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">32</td>
<td id="S3.T1.4.5.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">38</td>
<td id="S3.T1.4.5.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">28</td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T1.4.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T1.4.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">200–249</td>
<td id="S3.T1.4.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">18</td>
<td id="S3.T1.4.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">9</td>
<td id="S3.T1.4.6.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">17</td>
<td id="S3.T1.4.6.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">9</td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T1.4.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T1.4.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_bb"><math id="S3.T1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&gt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math> 250</td>
<td id="S3.T1.4.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_bb">24</td>
<td id="S3.T1.4.7.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_bb">13</td>
<td id="S3.T1.4.7.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_bb">4</td>
<td id="S3.T1.4.7.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_bb">3</td></tr>
</table>
</figure>
<div id="S3.SS2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS2.p3.1" class="ltx_p">For our experiment, we used the Java code files from the GitHub repository <span id="S3.SS2.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">‘‘The Algorithms – Java’’</span> <span id="footnote3" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">3</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">3</sup>
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">3</span>
              
              
              
            <a href="https://github.com/TheAlgorithms/Java/" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://github.com/TheAlgorithms/Java/</a></span></span></span> for three reasons: (1) This repository provides a structured and diverse collection of Java implementations of various algorithms, covering a wide range of problem domains such as searching, sorting, mathematics, and data structures; (2) it is designed for educational and comparative purposes, ensuring that the code follows consistent formatting and best practices, which facilitates systematic analysis; (3) as an open-source repository under MIT license with active contributions, it ensures accessibility and reproducibility, both of which are essential for a rigorous research experiment.</p>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS2.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS2.p4.1" class="ltx_p">We summarized the counts of files in the repository that fulfill our conditions (excluding test files) in Table <a href="#S3.T1" title="Table 1 ‣ 3.2. Snippet Sampling and Data Preprocessing ‣ 3. Methodology ‣ From Restructuring to Stabilization: A Large-Scale Experiment on Iterative Code Readability Refactoring with Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>. There are <math id="S3.SS2.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="230" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>230</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">230</annotation></semantics></math> of originally <math id="S3.SS2.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="658" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>658</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">658</annotation></semantics></math> files that fulfill all of our criteria. Next, for each of these <math id="S3.SS2.p4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="230" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>230</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">230</annotation></semantics></math> files, we created three variants:</p>
<ul id="S3.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S3.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S3.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.I2.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S3.I2.i1.p1.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="6.57" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:0.29px" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 6.57 6.57" width="6.57"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#0000FF;--ltx-fill-color:#0000FF;--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" color="#0000FF" fill="#0000FF" stroke="#0000FF" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,6.57) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0) translate(3.28,0) translate(0,3.28)"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 M 3.28 0 C 3.28 1.81 1.81 3.28 0 3.28 C -1.81 3.28 -3.28 1.81 -3.28 0 C -3.28 -1.81 -1.81 -3.28 0 -3.28 C 1.81 -3.28 3.28 -1.81 3.28 0 Z M 0 0"></path></g></svg></span>
 <span id="S3.I2.i1.p1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Original</span></span><span id="S3.I2.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> variant</span>: The unchanged original implementation.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S3.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.I2.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S3.I2.i2.p1.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="6.75" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:1.33px" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 7.79 6.75" width="7.79"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#008000;" fill="#008000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,6.75) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0) translate(3.9,0) translate(0,2.25)"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 4.5 L -3.9 -2.25 L 3.9 -2.25 Z"></path></g></svg></span>
 <span id="S3.I2.i2.p1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Meaningless</span></span><span id="S3.I2.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> variant</span>: Variable, method, and class names as well as all content in JavaDocs and comments are intentionally made meaningless, while preserving structure.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S3.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.I2.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S3.I2.i3.p1.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="5.52" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:0.82px" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 5.52 5.52" width="5.52"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#FF0000;" fill="#FF0000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,5.52) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0) translate(2.76,0) translate(0,2.76)"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 2.76 2.76 L -2.76 2.76 L -2.76 -2.76 L 2.76 -2.76 Z"></path></g></svg></span>
 <span id="S3.I2.i3.p1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">NoComment</span></span><span id="S3.I2.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> variant</span>: All JavaDocs as well as block and inline comments are completely removed.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<figure id="S3.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2. </span>Wording of the three different prompts used in the experiment.</figcaption>
<table id="S3.T2.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="S3.T2.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T2.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt">Prompt ID</td>
